<title>CYPRUS: Cyprus to auction 91-day t-bills worth 25 mln.</title>
<headline>Cyprus to auction 91-day t-bills worth 25 mln.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The central bank on Monday said it will auction 91-day treasury bills worth up to 25 million pounds ($48.5 million) with a May 14 issue date.</p>
<p>Bids, which can be competitive or non competitive, can be made for the issue from May 12 to May 14 at 9.00 a.m. local (0600 GMT), the bank said. ($=0.514 pounds)</p>
<p>-- Nicosia newsroom 357 2 365089</p>
